---
layout: base.njk
title: Studies
extraBodyScripts:
  - /assets/js/study-list.js
---
<div class="container">
<div class="card-body">
  <div class="d-flex flex-row bd-highlight mb-3">
    <div style="margin-right:1em;">
      <h2>Your Studies</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    A study is a causal diagram plus your treatment, outcome, and how you've
    grouped them &mdash; see <a href="/articles/study/" target="_blank">what a Study is</a>
    and <a href="/articles/causal-diagram/" target="_blank">how to draw a causal diagram</a>
    for background.
  </p>

  <div id="studies-no-dataset" class="alert alert-warning" hidden>
    You'll need a dataset before creating a study &mdash;
    <a href="/data/">upload one first</a>.
  </div>

  <div class="card card-body mb-4" id="studies-create-card" hidden>
    <h5>Create a new study</h5>
    <form id="create-form">
      <div class="mb-3">
        <label for="study-name" class="form-label">Name</label>
        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="study-name" placeholder="e.g. Effect of onboarding on retention" />
      </div>
      <div class="mb-3">
        <label for="study-dataset" class="form-label">Dataset</label>
        <select class="form-select" id="study-dataset"></select>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success">Create</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div id="study-list-empty" class="alert alert-secondary" hidden>
    No studies yet &mdash; create one above to get started.
  </div>

  <table class="table" id="study-table" hidden>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Name</th>
        <th>Dataset</th>
        <th>Modified</th>
        <th></th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="study-table-body"></tbody>
  </table>
</div>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="delete-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title">Delete study?</h5>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>This removes <strong id="delete-modal-name"></strong> from this browser. This can't be undone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" id="delete-modal-confirm">Delete</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
